ng them to you, or send them into the void.  \n[2] Crash or lag the server.  \n[3] Features like making parts of the map explode (among many others).  \n[4] Duplicate objects and create shapes with them.\n\nThere are many more features! If you’re interested in the script, you can join our Discord:  \n\n--> https://discord.gg/WuNdeVuyVz\n\nAbout MangoHub:\n\nThe script uses a key system with two checkpoints, and the key lasts for 48 hours.  \n\nIt features a clean, minimalist GUI that’s easy to navigate and understand.  \n\nIf you have any questions or issues, you can open a ticket on our Discord, and we’ll be happy to help!","tags":["KeySystem"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6526cc9116108151e8eae4a6","username":"llllll","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/46d969b036f4124c9de8a03ab78a84c62825d8d93f0f884573d81b0b34df6765.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6526cc9116108151e8eae4a6-1697041952627.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6526cc9116108151e8eae4a6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/46d969b036f4124c9de8a03ab78a84c62825d8d93f0f884573d81b0b34df6765.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6526cc9116108151e8eae4a6-1697041952627.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T02:44:27.242Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68977daffddb2fd8c85c001b","editBy":{"_id":"6526cc9116108151e8eae4a6","username":"llllll","status":"offline","id":"6526cc9116108151e8eae4a6"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-08-09T16:56:15.391Z"}],"comments":[]}